<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11732] Multi-merged partitions exchange future may hang if node left event is received last</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11732</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The scenario is similar to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11204&quot; title=&quot;Merged partitions exchange future ignores NODE_LEFT/FAILED events for merged exchanges&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11204&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11204&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, but several exchanges should be merged. If in this case a merged-exchange node is left and all other nodes messages are already received, the exchange will not be completed because &lt;tt&gt;F.isEmpty(mergedJoinExchMsgs)&lt;/tt&gt; is &lt;tt&gt;false&lt;/tt&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;
Looks like we should decrement the &lt;tt&gt;awaitMergedMsgs&lt;/tt&gt; and check this field for &lt;tt&gt;0&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
